      "headline": "Golkar regional chairman stabbed and killed at airport ahead of party congress",
      "summary": "Agrapinus Rumatora alias 'Nus Kei,' chairman of the Golkar party branch in Maluku Tenggara, was stabbed by two men at the Karel Sadsuitubun airport on April 19 as he arrived for the party's regional congress (Musda). He was taken to hospital but did not survive. Police arrested two suspects \u2014 one identified as a mixed martial arts athlete \u2014 within two hours, with investigators citing a long-standing personal vendetta as the suspected motive. The Golkar national executive (DPP) condemned the killing and urged cadres not to be provoked.",
